    gui_font_registered_face_simple_glyph_indexed_stroke_compositor_tile_rle_begin_frame_record_owner_free gui_font_registered_face_simple_glyph_indexed_stroke_compositor_tile_rle_begin_frame_virtual_drain_owner_take_record_owner owner

